  "$comment": "Campaign level 26 (S4 L7-C, chapter 3 opener): a tall volcanic cone in the middle of a green island. The player lands at the southern foot, an aggressive rival holds the north shore. Staged: climb past the wolf den on the slope and pray at the summit altar (a Reliquary: it teaches Volcano, gives one charge of it and the Watchtower craft, so towers cannot be raised before the summit); raise two Watchtowers (two flat terraces on the slope are marked with cairns); cut down ten northern raiders (a war band comes over the mountain when the towers stand, and fresh bands every two minutes until the kill stage ends); then burn the northern Hearth (a destroy, not eliminateAll); six hill clan wardens join the player when the kill stage ends. The rival is capped at 8 troops and 30 people. The rival only prays for the altar late (worshipAfterSeconds), so an idle player loses the altar (siteLost) or the clock. Every three minutes the east vent erupts (a firerain spell cast by the level; level spells spare the player's tribe, so it only scorches rivals and beasts there). Bot (offset 1) wins about 14780; offsets 0 and 3 win near 12420 and 17590 of the 30000 limit.",
